name: The Manacle — hand size reduction
author: corpus
description: >-
  The Manacle reduces Hand Size by 1. Ante 1 boss: pair with hand-size offset (Juggler,
  Troubadour, Paint Brush) and small-hand builds.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - boss: TheManacle
    antes: [1]
should:
  - joker: Juggler
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Troubadour
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
  - voucher: PaintBrush
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 30
